7. Gemini AI Testing
AI testing is particularly important because Gemini responses are not completely deterministic.
The testing should verify both content quality and technical validity.
Test criteria
•	Response is returned successfully.
•	Required fields are present.
•	Structured output is valid.
•	Number of panels matches the requested range.
•	Characters referenced in dialogue exist.
•	Dialogue belongs to the correct characters.
•	Generated content is relevant to the user's prompt.
•	Generated content does not contain unexpected system instructions or application data.
•	Invalid AI responses are handled gracefully.
