19. Security Testing
Security testing should cover:
Authentication
•	Invalid login attempts
•	Session expiration
•	Unauthorized API access
Authorization
Verify that:
User A
  ↓
Can access User A projects

User B
  ↓
Cannot access User A projects
API Security
Test:
•	Invalid authentication tokens
•	Missing authentication
•	Invalid project IDs
•	Malformed requests
•	Excessive requests
Secret Protection
Verify that:
•	Gemini credentials are not included in frontend code.
•	Secrets are stored in environment/configuration management.
•	Secrets are not written to logs.
