21. Performance Testing
Performance testing determines whether ComicCraft remains responsive under expected usage.
Areas to test
•	Dashboard loading
•	Project loading
•	Database queries
•	AI generation requests
•	Image uploads
•	Comic preview
•	PDF generation
AI generation naturally depends on external service response time, so the interface should provide a loading/progress state rather than appearing frozen.
Example:
