26. Bug Tracking
Detected problems should be recorded and categorized.
Priority	Description
Critical	Application unusable/security-critical issue
High	Major feature does not work
Medium	Feature works incorrectly in some cases
Low	Minor UI or cosmetic issue
Example:
Bug ID: BUG-004

Module: Comic Editor

Problem:
Panel order changes unexpectedly after saving.

Priority:
High

Status:
Open → Fixed → Retested
________________________________________
27. Regression Testing
After fixing a bug or adding a feature, previously working functionality should be tested again.
Example:
Fix Panel Editor
      ↓
Test Panel Editor
      ↓
Test Story Generation
      ↓
Test Database Saving
      ↓
Test Preview
      ↓
Test Export
This ensures that changes to one component do not break other parts of ComicCraft.
